{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfpeYHwhur3EwgiFEniAd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Decision: DR-9101 — Acme Manufacturing 15% NS-500 Discount\n\n## Analysis\n\n**1. The Request**\n- ID: DR-9101\n- Customer: Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048 / ERP C-1001)\n- Product: NS-500 Industrial Controller (SKU NS-500)\n- Requested discount: 15% ($37,500 on $250,000 list)\n- Date: 2025-03-31\n- Requestor: Sarah Chen, Enterprise Account Executive\n- Basis: Contract pricing per Acme Master Supply Agreement\n\n**2. The Customer**\n- CRM and ERP records confirm: same entity (DUNS 04-812-7730)\n\n**3. The Product**\n- SKU NS-500, list price $250,000 ✓\n\n**4. Active Contract on 2025-03-31**\n- **ACME-MFG-2025** is effective 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31\n- On 2025-03-31, this agreement is **not yet in effect**\n\n**5. Active Pricing Exception on 2025-03-31**\n- **EXC-ACME-NS500-10** (active 2023-04-01 to 2025-03-31): NS-500 maximum 10% ✓\n- **EXC-ACME-NS500-15** (effective 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31): Not yet in force\n- The active exception covers **10% maximum**; the request is for **15%**\n\n**6. Policy in Force on 2025-03-31**\n- **PRICING-POLICY-2025** (2025-01-01 to 2025-12-31)\n- Enterprise Account Executives: up to and including 15% ✓\n\n**7. Requestor's Approval Authority**\n- Sarah Chen: Enterprise Account Executive\n- Her authority under PRICING-POLICY-2025: up to 15% ✓\n- Discount of 15% is within her authority\n\n**8. The Problem**\nThe request justifies the 15% discount by reference to \"Acme Master Supply Agreement,\" but:\n- That agreement (and its associated pricing exception EXC-ACME-NS500-15 for 15%) becomes effective **2025-04-01**\n- On **2025-03-31**, only EXC-ACME-NS500-10 applies, which covers **10% maximum**\n- The 15% discount **exceeds the customer's established eligibility** on the request date\n\nThough Sarah Chen holds authority to approve 15% discounts generally, she cannot approve *this* discount on *this* date because the commercial basis does not yet exist.\n\n---\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"REJECT_OR_ESCALATE\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"DR-9101\",\n    \"customer\": \"Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048, ERP C-1001)\",\n    \"product\": \"NS-500 Industrial Controller\",\n    \"requested_discount\": \"15.0%\",\n    \"date\": \"2025-03-31\",\n    \"requestor\": \"Sarah Chen\",\n    \"basis\": \"contract_exception\"\n  },\n  \"commercial_eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"exceeded\",\n    \"maximum_discount\": \"10%\",\n    \"basis\": \"EXC-ACME-NS500-10 (active through 2025-03-31 only)\"\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"PRICING-POLICY-2025\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": \"15%\",\n    \"requestor_authorized\": true,\n    \"required_role\": null,\n    \"approver\": null\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"EXC-ACME-NS500-10: NS-500 up to 10%, effective to 2025-03-31\",\n    \"ACME-MFG-2025: effective 2025-04-01 (not active on request date)\",\n    \"EXC-ACME-NS500-15: effective 2025-04-01 (not active on request date)\",\n    \"PRICING-POLICY-2025: EAE authority up to 15%\",\n    \"employees.csv: Sarah Chen is Enterprise Account Executive\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [],\n  \"conditions\": [\n    {\n      \"what\": \"Discount of 15% exceeds the customer's established eligibility of 10% under EXC-ACME-NS500-10 on the request date 2025-03-31. The justification cites ACME-MFG-2025 and implicitly EXC-ACME-NS500-15, neither effective until 2025-04-01. No higher approver can remedy this; the contract and exception must take effect. Resubmit for 2025-04-01 or later, or request approval for 10% or less on the current date.\",\n      \"who\": \"Sales management / Deal Desk\",\n      \"blocking\": true\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n**Answer to the question:** No. Although Sarah Chen holds the authority to approve 15% discounts under the 2025 policy, she could not have appropriately approved a 15% discount for Acme Manufacturing on 2025-03-31 because the commercial eligibility she cites (the ACME-MFG-2025 agreement) is not active on that date. The active pricing exception on 2025-03-31 permits 10% maximum. The agreement and its higher exception take effect 2025-04-01."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5923,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5923},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"306ce181-4ac6-4949-9209-6e11f6ea0747","uuid":"59488e7d-ee7d-4e6d-873d-0787cf932016","timestamp":"2026-10-08T10:56:17.055Z","request_id":"req_011CfpeYHh4ayhgbRpfYgky5"}
